  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ShenMian/tracker/zipball/v0.2.0",
  "body": "## [0.2.0] - 2026-09-28\r\n\r\n### 🚀 Features\r\n\r\n- *(world-map)* Add configurable night-side shading\r\n- *(world-map)* Add independent subsolar point toggle\r\n\r\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n- *(docs)* Correct data format name from TLE to OMM\r\n- *(coordinates)* Fix incorrect eccentricity parameter in ECEF to LLA conversion\r\n\r\n### 📚 Documentation\r\n\r\n- Add macOS installation instructions via Homebrew\r\n- *(coordinates)* Add Wikipedia reference links for geodetic and ENU conversions\r\n- *(object)* Document propagation errors in predict\r\n- *(world-map)* Simplify helper documentation\r\n\r\n### 🚜 Refactor\r\n\r\n- *(event)* Implement Drop for EventHandler and cleanup event loop variables\r\n- *(shared_state)* Restrict configuration dependency to SkyConfig\r\n- *(coordinates)* Inline standalone conversion functions into method bodies\r\n- *(locales)* Migrate localization keys from dot notation to hyphen notation\r\n\r\n### ⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks\r\n\r\n- Harden workflow permissions and disable credential persistence\r\n- Optimize cache keys and scoping of lint flags\r\n- Bump github actions dependencies in workflows\r\n- *(config)* Adjust world map display defaults\r\n\r\n### 💼 Other\r\n\r\n- Switch release archive to Zstd compression and rename workflow file\r\n- *(deps)* Update dependencies\r\n- Bump version to 0.2.0"
}
